# Node.js

- Prefer **async/await** over raw Promise chains; centralize error handling at boundaries (HTTP handlers, CLI entrypoints).
- Validate inputs at edges (HTTP, IPC, env) with a schema library when the project already uses one.
- Never log secrets; redact tokens and PII in structured logs.
